<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/54/eng@/~cl_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in the definition of “resident”, by substituting for the words “pursuant to section 43 of the Exchange Control Act 1953 [Act 17]” the words “pursuant to paragraph 214(6)(a) of the Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 758] and paragraph 225(6)(a) of the Islamic Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 759]”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/54/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/54/eng@/~cl_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/54/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/54/eng@> .
